@startuml Preciazo_DB_Shopping_Planning

title Preciazo - Shopping Planning Database Diagram

hide circle
skinparam linetype ortho

entity shopping_lists {
    * id : BIGINT <<PK>>
    --
    owner_id : BIGINT <<REF>>
    name : VARCHAR
    currency : VARCHAR
    status : VARCHAR
    created_at : TIMESTAMP
    completed_at : TIMESTAMP <<NULLABLE>>
    version : BIGINT
    source_template_id : BIGINT <<FK, NULLABLE>>
    creation_key : VARCHAR <<NULLABLE>>
    creation_fingerprint : VARCHAR <<NULLABLE>>
}

entity shopping_list_members {
    * shopping_list_id : BIGINT <<PK, FK>>
    * user_id : BIGINT <<PK, REF>>
    --
    member_role : VARCHAR
}

entity shopping_list_items {
    * id : BIGINT <<PK>>
    --
    shopping_list_id : BIGINT <<FK>>
    product_id : BIGINT <<REF>>
    requested_name : VARCHAR
    quantity : DECIMAL
    quantity_unit : VARCHAR
    estimated_unit_price : DECIMAL
    price_currency : VARCHAR
    price_per_quantity : DECIMAL
    price_per_unit : VARCHAR
    purchased : BOOLEAN
    catalog_entry_id : BIGINT <<REF, NULLABLE>>
    price_offer_version : BIGINT <<NULLABLE>>
    price_captured_at : TIMESTAMP <<NULLABLE>>
}

entity purchase_budgets {
    * id : BIGINT <<PK>>
    --
    shopping_list_id : BIGINT <<FK, UQ>>
    amount : DECIMAL
    currency : VARCHAR
}

entity shopping_templates {
    * id : BIGINT <<PK>>
    --
    owner_id : BIGINT <<REF>>
    name : VARCHAR
    currency : VARCHAR
    source_list_id : BIGINT <<FK>>
    source_list_version : BIGINT
    save_key : VARCHAR
    save_fingerprint : VARCHAR
    created_at : TIMESTAMP
}

entity shopping_template_items {
    * id : BIGINT <<PK>>
    --
    template_id : BIGINT <<FK>>
    product_id : BIGINT <<REF>>
    requested_name : VARCHAR
    quantity : DECIMAL
    quantity_unit : VARCHAR
}

entity favorite_stores {
    * id : BIGINT <<PK>>
    --
    owner_id : BIGINT <<REF>>
    store_id : BIGINT <<REF>>
    active : BOOLEAN
    version : BIGINT
    created_at : TIMESTAMP
    updated_at : TIMESTAMP
}

shopping_lists ||--o{ shopping_templates : completed source
shopping_templates ||--|{ shopping_template_items
shopping_templates |o--o{ shopping_lists : optional clone origin

shopping_lists ||--o{ shopping_list_members
shopping_lists ||--o{ shopping_list_items
shopping_lists ||--o| purchase_budgets


note right of shopping_list_items
  product_id belongs to
  Catalog and Pricing.
  Offer id/version/captured-at are either all absent or all present.
  Template clones require all three, from trusted current-price inputs.
end note

note right of purchase_budgets
  UNIQUE(shopping_list_id): one optional budget per list.
  amount > 0; currency matches shopping_lists.currency.
  Changing the budget updates its limit; invalid input is rejected.
  Totals and budget warnings are derived on query, not stored.
  Warning: defined limit AND projected total > limit.
  Clear warning at or below the limit; no warning event is stored.
end note

note bottom of shopping_list_items
  UNIQUE(shopping_list_id, product_id).
  Adding an existing product increases quantity without a duplicate.
  quantity > 0; price_per_quantity > 0; estimated_unit_price >= 0.
  Quantity and price units must be compatible; price currency matches the list.
  Subtotal = estimated_unit_price * quantity / price_per_quantity
  after converting quantity to price_per_unit.
  Projected total sums all subtotals; checkout total sums purchased items only.
  Unmarking sets purchased = false and reduces checkout total on the next query.
end note

note right of shopping_templates
  Immutable; UNIQUE(owner_id, save_key); fingerprint detects incompatible retries.
  Source belongs to owner, is COMPLETED/nonempty and matches source_list_version.
  Copy all requested products and quantities; no budget, price, members or purchase flags.
  Save template and items atomically; later clones do not change the source.
end note

note bottom of shopping_template_items
  UNIQUE(template_id, product_id); quantity > 0 with valid compatible unit.
  Each product requires one current selected offer before creating a new list.
  Missing prices are never replaced with zero or historical template prices.
end note

note right of favorite_stores
  UNIQUE(owner_id, store_id); version protects concurrent preference changes.
  GET returns active preferences only; removal preserves identity with active=false.
  Re-add reactivates; repeated add/remove is a no-op without a new event.
  Removing an owned preference does not require a live store reference.
  Preferences do not change prices, geographic eligibility or the US13 cost ranking.
end note

note right of shopping_lists
  ACTIVE / COMPLETED; new lists start ACTIVE, completed lists are read-only.
  UNIQUE(owner_id, creation_key) for non-null template-creation keys.
  Key/fingerprint/source-template fields must be set together for template clones.
  Completion requires at least one item, records completed_at and increments version.
  Clone items/prices and list are saved atomically; failed repricing creates no list.
  Template clones reset purchased=false and do not copy source budget or members.
  All commands authorize owner_id; reserved memberships grant no write access here.
end note

@enduml
